---
title: Hotfix Flow
---
flowchart TD
    ISSUE[Bug found in<br/>UAT or PROD]
    BRANCH[Branch from release/sprint-12<br/>hotfix/fix-payment-calc]
    FIX[Develop fix]
    PR_REL[PR to release/sprint-12]
    MERGE_REL[Merged to release branch]
    BUILD[build.yml<br/>Artifact created]
    UAT[deploy.yml → UAT]
    DM[deploy.yml → DM]
    GOLD[release.yml → GOLD]
    PROD[release.yml → PROD]
    PR_MAIN[PR to main]
    MERGE_MAIN[Merged to main<br/>Prevents regression in next sprint]

    ISSUE --> BRANCH
    BRANCH --> FIX
    FIX --> PR_REL
    PR_REL --> MERGE_REL
    MERGE_REL --> BUILD
    BUILD --> UAT
    UAT --> DM
    DM --> GOLD
    GOLD -->|approval| PROD

    FIX --> PR_MAIN
    PR_MAIN --> MERGE_MAIN

    style ISSUE fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style MERGE_REL fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#2196f3
    style MERGE_MAIN fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4caf50
    style PROD fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
